expected_issues.description:
The raw string literals for the example SQL/output include leading indentation and an extra newline after R"(, which may render with unwanted whitespace in generated documentation/tests. Consider left-aligning the content (or using a helper to trim) so the displayed example matches expected formatting exactly.

```suggestion
    FunctionDocumentation::Examples examples = {
        {
            "Usage example",
            R"(SELECT
    '<tag>Hello & "World"</tag>' AS original,
    encodeXMLComponent('<tag>Hello & "World"</tag>') AS xml_encoded;)",
            R"(┌─original───────────────────┬─xml_encoded──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ <tag>Hello & "World"</tag> │ &lt;tag&gt;Hello &amp; &quot;World&quot;&lt;/tag&gt; │
└────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘)"
        }
    };
```

